<title>USA: ERO names Mark Renfree as CFO.</title>
<headline>ERO names Mark Renfree as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT PROSPECT, Ill. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ERO Inc, a marketer of children's leisure products, said it named Mark Renfree as senior vice president of finance and chief financial officer, succeeding Ted Lueken, who left in August to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Renfree has been CFO of Progroup Inc and Premier Health Alliance.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
